**Recruitment SEO is search work for recruitment agencies and in-house talent teams: getting jobs indexed, ranking for sector and location searches and winning employer enquiries. I run it as an independent consultant from Reading in Berkshire and work UK-wide online. The usual starting point is a £495 fixed technical SEO audit. A monthly retainer can follow. Start with a free 20-minute SEO diagnosis.**

Recruitment sites have two audiences and one fast-moving inventory. Candidates search for jobs. Employers search for a firm that can fill roles. Jobs open and close every week. Indexing problems build up quickly when the site is not set up for them.

